    "displayName": "Alliance Aid: Large Supply of Research Resource",
    "titleSource": "localized_clean",
    "titleConfidence": "high",
    "briefing": "To all available contractors,\n\nRayari scientists are working around-the-clock to assist with the treatment for the current fungal outbreak in Levski. Due to logistic issues, our team at [Destination] is running low on a key resource in their research. Losing production at that location would hamper the Alliance Aid’s effort to cure people suffering from this terrible affliction in a timely manner.\n\nThat’s why we're eager for the help of anyone who can find and deliver this vital supply to [Destination].\n\nPlease remember that contracted goods are tracked by their legal owners and can't be accepted.\n\nTogether we can make the universe better for all.\n\nNarina Lerrem\nSenior Manager\nClinical Research Outsourcing",
